            "end_line": 320,
            "exact_code_raw_sha256": "6b1534319ef567ec26d3e99b42d4fe3096fb6a8f24867a6d6395ad5be6eac88f"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Adjoin the universal identity to actual conditional components",
          "text": "For each globally centered f, retain its actual f_P, f_V, g, g_P and g_V, output mean, projected formulas, pair energy and B21 corrector change. Add only the identity for arbitrary u,v,r in the same H_P^0 and same C scope. No identification of r with the still-unconstructed source residual is made.",
          "formula": "C(g_P,g_V)-C(f_P,f_V)=-\\|f_P\\|^2+\\|f_V\\|^2,\\qquad\\forall u,v,r\\in H_P^0:\\ C(u+\\Gamma_0r,v-A_0r)-C(u,v)=\\langle u,\\operatorname{Inv}r\\rangle+\\tfrac12\\|r\\|^2.",
          "lean": "  have hGlobal72 :\n      (∀ f : Lp ℝ 2 J, (∫ z, f z ∂J)=0 →\n                            ∃ fP : HP0,\n                              HP0.subtypeL fP=condExpL2 ℝ ℝ (μ:=J) measurable_snd.comap_le f ∧\n                              let fperp : Hperp := R f\n                              let fV : HP0 := V0.adjoint fperp\n                              B.adjoint (fperp : Lp ℝ 2 J)=HP0.subtypeL (ΓP0 fV) ∧\n                              HP0.subtypeL (ΓP0 fV)=ΓP (HP0.subtypeL fV) ∧\n                              ‖f‖^2=‖fP‖^2+‖fperp‖^2 ∧ ‖fV‖≤‖fperp‖ ∧\n                              let g : Lp ℝ 2 J := U (P f-(f-P f))\n                              (∫ z, g z ∂J)=0 ∧\n                              ∃ gP : HP0,\n                                HP0.subtypeL gP=condExpL2 ℝ ℝ (μ:=J) measurable_snd.comap_le g ∧\n                                let gperp : Hperp := R g\n                                let gV : HP0 := V0.adjoint gperp\n                                gP=A0 fP-ΓP0 fV ∧\n                                gV=ΓP0 fP+A0 fV ∧\n                                ‖gP‖^2+‖gV‖^2=‖fP‖^2+‖fV‖^2 ∧\n                                let C : HP0 → HP0 → ℝ := fun u v =>\n                                  (‖u‖^2-‖v‖^2)/2-inner ℝ (A0 (Inv u)) v\n                                C gP gV-C fP fV= -‖fP‖^2+‖fV‖^2 ∧\n                                (∀ u v r : HP0,\n                                  C (u+ΓP0 r) (v-A0 r)-C u v=\n                                    inner ℝ u (Inv r)+‖r‖^2/2)) := by\n    intro f hf\n    obtain ⟨fP,hpf,hB,hEmbed,hEnergy,hVbound,hgMean,gP,hgpf,hgp,hgv,hPair,hCorrector⟩ :=\n      hGlobal f hf\n    refine ⟨fP,hpf,hB,hEmbed,hEnergy,hVbound,hgMean,gP,hgpf,hgp,hgv,hPair,hCorrector,?_⟩\n    exact hPerturb\n",
          "detail": "Exact compiled contiguous BODY span; preceding local definitions and inherited Hilbert structures remain in scope.",
          "lean_source_region": {
            "path": "AutoSamplingTheory/ExampleCases/ProximalBPS/ActualCorrectorPerturbation.lean",
