        {
          "title": "Reassemble the original-input theorem without an extra premise",
          "text": "Keep the all-ker-P intertwining and every previous law, kernel, root, inverse and polar conclusion with the same witness tuple. The final theorem now contains the perturbation identity. Producing actual H/K/r_rho/B27 and using it in B28 remains a separate source dependency.",
